e": "Interview_skills_Screenshot_03_2560X1440.png", "id": "1002386077791873", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982603_1002386081125206_5702072810957381411_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=44hnD0kNgNMQ7kNvwFUayLC&_nc_oc=AdnmCdGxHF0a9WHbMXd4234hteTzwhSBI_SRA8yWLe6qroxpy2KEazB70m2khucO-TY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuxzQi0P4rVrim1ySN7Oikzx6hZnRus6Xk_zMsL7_KTrw&oe=69A03088"}, {"file_name": "Interview_skills_Screenshot_04_2560X1440.png", "id": "1352903858985422", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974527_1352903865652088_5199668828185934014_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jxhLmp4o8NoQ7kNvwETwc_a&_nc_oc=AdnQAOVT5R7F9_HciFy2g19p9qxCSJj8PU9PgBeg3wOJnlDIKnesX80IxdRES7A0CUM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvf6_7D-WBlrLfpuKLoPhsHQ4wGvsoJEN0mpdN83vNtgw&oe=69A05D68"}, {"file_name": "Interview_skills_Screenshot_05_2560X1440.png", "id": "6388885501227348", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_6388885504560681_5773199120977009194_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GgaGeoXMG9MQ7kNvwHZETpu&_nc_oc=Adn70SABARSxkIbGRLPLgPVMgpsirSwuAM2M0TLKsJlBGq37YFYcaUaVTjbPMEkrwiU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs116UhoW_ibx1y6K3ONuDmr5i30DMP7odUl4JH1jf29A&oe=69A051D4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Interview_skills_Screenshot_01_2560X1440.png", "id": "307703721692608", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982516_307703725025941_2021162934857628277_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tnqvBRNO1MIQ7kNvwGPfruK&_nc_oc=AdmMW5okYU3FBVwx95h3gzOiTWpdl_vwOKQ_UvncXTGDYy-SfwCcA6XY9BzZxjpS4pY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv7DUbfOrubcpAkS6F25sbf29gRceLMCH7sfp7Pl3z00Q&oe=69A028C3"}, "display_name": "VR Interview Skills", "keywords": ["interview", "training"], "long_description": "Our Virtual Reality Interview Skills training package is designed to help candidates seeking employment significantly elevate their interview skills. This immersive VR training provides a hands-on experience for mastering interview techniques while building self confidence in the process. Participants can explore the VR environment at their own pace and engage in one-on-one conversations or formal panel interviews. \nA comprehensive pre-interview checklist initiates the process, guiding participants through crucial preparation steps. This tool prepares candidates for real-life job interviews. Real-time feedback and auditory cues foster a continuous learning environment, and the ability to revisit the VR interview simulation reinforces the learning process.\n\nKey Features and Learning Objectives:\n\u2022Two Interview Styles: Practice both informal interviews with one person and formal interview scenarios with two people.\n\u2022Realistic Interactions: The simulation incorporates a realistic question-and-answer flow that emulates real-world interviews. \n\u2022Expertly Crafted Content: Material researched and designed by subject matter experts.\n\u2022Embedded Learning Objectives: Ensures participants can recall, understand, and apply the necessary skills for successful real-life interviews. \n\u2022Seamless Navigation: Hand-tracking and voice-to-text are the primary navigation methods.", "short_description": "Our Virtual Reality Interview Skills training package is designed to help candidates seeking employment significantly elevate their interview skills. This immersive VR training provides a hands-on experience for mastering interview techniques while building self confidence in the process. Participants can explore the VR environment at their own pace and engage in one-on-one conversations or formal panel interviews.   "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.holopundits.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Holo Pundits